OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 2 JAN
OL,4,G1000FAled Jones
OL,5,     GAled invites you to join him for
OL,6,     Gthree hours of the best classical
OL,7,     Gmusic, with an unmissable morning
OL,8,     Gof old favourites and new
OL,9,     Gdiscoveries.
OL,10,G1300FMargherita Taylor
OL,11,     GMargherita Taylor is your host,
OL,12,     Gaccompanying you throughout the
OL,13,     Gafternoon with three hours of
OL,14,     Gfavourites and new discoveries.
OL,15,G1600FJohn Brunning
OL,16,     GJoin John for an evening of the
OL,17,     Gmost relaxing music. Switch-on to
OL,18,     G'switch-off' and enjoy the very
OL,19,     Gbest soothing sounds to help you
OL,20,     Grelax and recharge.
